 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "To Kill With Kindness"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Lunaria and Tess: two artificial beings created in a secret facility housing the world's greatest minds. Lunaria, a sweet and innocent girl, coexists peacefully with her creators--until the day of Tess's creation. When Tess unleashes her powers in a murderous rampage, Lunaria scrambles for safety as the facility descends into chaos. But before she can hide away, she comes face-to-face with Tess. Will Lunaria become her next victim? Or will something entirely different occur?"
  },
